# =============================================================================
#  CAV-HCI.orch - MPAI Human-CAV Interaction (CAV-HCI of MPAI-CAV V2.0)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module. The User Agent offers the Controller data
#  identified by Data Type and Port Number, and asks for data identified the
#  same way. It names no AIM.
#
#  The Module is Human-CAV Interaction: the passenger in the cabin speaks and
#  shows the face; the cabin's LiDAR gives the scene. The Module describes the
#  audio and visual scene, recognises the passenger and what is said, and
#  answers with its Portable Avatar. The User Agent of this App is a window of
#  its own (Apps\CAV\HCIApps\HciApp) with the camera and the microphone of the
#  cabin.
#
#  Made 2026-11-25 from the turn of the HCI window (FrontEndTurnAsync).
# =============================================================================

workflow CAV-HCI over 1CAV-HCI-V2.0-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    prompt "Human-CAV Interaction: look at the camera and talk with the car."

    loop until Stop:

        acquire CabinAudio (OSD-BAO-V1.5) via VAD
        acquire Face (OSD-BVO-V1.5)
        acquire CabinLiDAR (OSD-BLO-V1.5)

        offer CabinAudio (OSD-BAO-V1.5:1)
        offer Face (OSD-BVO-V1.5:1)
        offer CabinLiDAR (OSD-BLO-V1.5:1)
        offer AvatarModel (OSD-B3O-V1.5:1) = "cav-avatar.glb"
        ask   PassengerID (OSD-IID-V1.5)
        ask   RecognisedText (OSD-BTO-V1.5:2)
        ask   MachinePortableAvatar (PAF-PAV-V1.6)
        present MachinePortableAvatar

on Stop:

    ask Controller to stop
